              <i class="fas fa-users" style="font-size: 4rem;"></i>
            </div>
            <div style="padding: 30px;">
              <div style="color: #25D366; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">May 5, 2024</div>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Building Customer Loyalty That Lasts</h3>
              <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Learn strategies from successful sellers on how to turn one-time buyers into lifetime customers. Includes real examples from our community...</p>
              <a href="#" style="color: #25D366; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                Read More <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

